 C/7A:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/7A - write the characters at M11 to the file at M12,
C stopping at the first NUL rather than at a count.
C
C   M11 = word address of the packed characters
C   M12 = the FILE record
C   M13 = return link
C
C P/7A is handed a count in M10 and writes exactly that many.
C This takes none: the string says where it ends, every string
C constant carrying a NUL that its type counts.  Six eight-bit
C characters to the word, most significant first, which is how
C pck packs them and how a string constant is laid down.
C
C The word being taken apart cannot stay in the accumulator:
C YTA replaces it with the character just shifted out of it, so
C between characters it lives in the runtime scratch word at
C M1+5, which is where P/7A keeps it too.
C
C P/HIDE stacks M6, M7, M8 and the link in M13, and P/EDIH puts
C them back.  That is what lets the loop hold its state in
C registers across P/PF, which returns none of them.
C===========================================================
 P/PF:          ,SUBP,        . put f^ and advance the file
 P/HIDE:        ,SUBP,        . stack M6, M7, M8 and M13
 P/EDIH:        ,SUBP,        . and put them back
              14,VJM,P/HIDE
              11,MTJ,8        . M8 := the word address
 NEXTWRD:      6,VTM,-5       . six characters to the word
               8,XTA,         . ACC := the packed word
               1,ATX,5        . the scratch holds what is left of it
 NEXTCH:       1,XTA,5
                ,ASN,64-8     . the top character falls out into Y
               1,ATX,5        . keep the rest of the word
                ,YTA,         . ACC := that character
                ,UZA,ENDSTR   . NUL ends the string
              12,WTC,         . address f^ through FILE[0]
                ,ATX,         . f^ := the character
              13,VJM,P/PF     . put it
               6,VLM,NEXTCH   . the other five characters
               8,UTM,1
                ,UJ,NEXTWRD   . and on into the next word
 ENDSTR:      14,VJM,P/EDIH   . M13 comes back with the rest
              13,UJ,
                ,END,
